#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-build-trace-info.md:20
msgid "Show some information about the build trace of the `hello` package:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-build-trace-info.md:22
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"$ nix store build-trace info nixpkgs#hello --json\n"
"[{\"id\":"
"\"sha256:3d382378a00588e064ee30be96dd0fa7e7df7cf3fbcace85a0e7b7dada1eef25!"
"out\",\"outPath\":\"fd3m7xawvrqcg98kgz5hc2vk3x9q0lh7-hello\"}]\n"
"```"
